  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town & School Election Results | Candia, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \n     About   \t\t\t \n     Contact  \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Explanation of SB2 \r\n\t\t\t Voter Information \r\n\t\t\t Town & School Election Results \r\n\t\t\t State Election Results \r\n\t\t\t Supervisor of the Checklist \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \nElections & Voting \nTown & School Election Results \r\nTown & School Election Results\t\t \r\nPast Town & School Election Results & Supporting Documentation \r\nMarch 10, 2026 Election \nElection Results (Town and School) for March 10, 2026 (PDF) : A list of write-ins is available at the Town Clerk's office. \n2025 Annual Report (44 MB) (PDF) : The annual report contains financial information, reports, and statistics submitted by town departments, boards, and committees, as well as the school district. To view annual reports from previous years, visit the  Annual Reports page . \nTown Ballot (PDF) \nSchool Ballot (PDF) \nZoning Amendment Number 1 - Solar Energy Systems (PDF) : The full ordinance, provided by the Planning Board. \nZoning Amendment Number 3 - Light Trespass (PDF) : The full ordinance, provided by the Planning Board. \nTown Deliberative Session Booklet (PDF) : The booklet for the town deliberative session contains the list of open positions, warrant articles, and proposed budget information. \nSchool Deliberative Session Booklet (PDF) : The booklet for the school deliberative session contains the warrant articles and proposed budget information. \nCandia Budget Process (PDF) : A guide to the budget process, provided to the voters of Candia by the Budget Committee. \r\nMarch 11, 2025 Election \nElection Results for March 11, 2025 (PDF) \n2024 Annual Report (PDF) : The annual report contains financial information, reports and statistics submitted by town departments, boards and committees, as well as the school district. To view annual reports from previous years, visit the  Annual Reports page . \nTax Impact Worksheet (PDF) : This document, provided by the Budget Committee for educational purposes only, shows what the warrant articles that we vote on in March will cost and informs voters of how items in the budget impact the tax rate. \nTown Deliberative Session Booklet (PDF) : The booklet for the town deliberative session contains the list of open positions, warrant articles, and proposed budget information. \nSchool Deliberative Session Booklet (PDF) : The booklet for the school deliberative session contains the warrant articles and proposed budget information. \nCandia Budget Process (PDF) : A guide to the budget process, provided to the voters of Candia by the Budget Committee. \r\nMarch 12, 2024 Election \nElection Results for March 12, 2024 (PDF) \n2023 Annual Report (PDF) : The annual report contains financial information, reports and statistics submitted by town departments, boards and committees. To view annual reports from previous years, visit the  Annual Reports page . \nTown Ballot (PDF) \nSchool Ballot (PDF) \nTax Impact Worksheet (PDF) : This document, provided by the Budget Committee for educational purposes only, shows what the warrant articles that we vote on in March will cost and informs voters of how items in the budget impact the tax rate. \nTown Deliberative Session Booklet (PDF) : The booklet for the town deliberative session contains the list of open positions, warrant articles, and proposed budget information. \nSCHOOL Deliberative Session Booklet (PDF) : The booklet for the school deliberative session contains the warrant articles and proposed budget information. \nCandia Budget Process (PDF) : A guide to the budget process, provided to the voters of Candia by the Budget Committee. \r\nMarch 14, 2023 Election \nElection 